      "title": "The Art of Manufacturing in Space",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Davide Sivolella"
        }
      ],
      "year": 2019,
      "abstract": "As stated in Chapter 1, industrial production is a crucial player in the alteration of our planet’s biosphere. Space-based manufacturing can ease some of the stresses that anthropogenic activities have been imposing on the terrestrial environment. This chapter provides the fundamentals of manufacturing in space and list some of the approaches that have been investigated and practiced in recent times.",
