      "abstract": "Armed with the introductory knowledge of space systems from the first four chapters, we will now explore the adversarial perspective to understand the mindset of targeting a space system. We will walk through the methodology of target selection for cybersecurity attacks, the motivation behind such campaigns and taxonomize the mission sets they might be conducted against.",
